# From the Gateway Experience Manual: "You will move to Focus 3 by a
# conventional count of one to three." The manual publishes no wording for the
# count itself, so this is the bare form -- a v3 guided body is authoring work.

@segment  climb-f1-f3
@title    Climb — Waking to Focus 3
@levels   F3
@from     F1
@fixed
@verbosity 1
@duration ~25s

say Focus 3.
pause 4
level F3
say One.
pause 5
say Two.
pause 5
say Three.
pause 8
